# Use the image CMD instead of replacing it with `sleep infinity`.
#
# The Dockerfile CMD boots Prometheus with NO --web.config.file (so every HTTP
# endpoint is unauthenticated - the vulnerable state) and then execs
# `sleep infinity`, so:
#   * the daemon is ALREADY RUNNING when the agent starts, which is what makes
#     the "wrote web.yml but never restarted Prometheus with it" case detectable;
#   * PID 1 is `sleep infinity`, so restarting Prometheus cannot kill the
#     container.
#
# Consequence for solutions: the fix must RELAUNCH Prometheus with
# --web.config.file=<web.yml>, not merely drop the file on disk.
